      {
        "description": "New Slack OAuth attempts for the affected connection path failed because the custom OAuth app's registered redirect URI did not match the authorization redirect URI being used; the displayed short connection link was substituted for the static callback URI. This explains why new connections failed while unrelated existing Slack usage still worked.",
