          "ev_4a7744d18321",
          "ev_199cec447840"
        ],
        "contradicting_evidence": [],
        "confidence": "high",
        "assumptions": [
          "The observed cedar failures correspond to new Slack connection attempts rather than unrelated Slack API calls.",
          "The sandbox controlled reproduction is representative of the production OAuth configuration difference."
        ]
      },
      {
        "description": "A Slack/provider-wide outage caused the failures.",
